com/html/page84.html\n\nサングラスは直接かけずに手に持つ等で、また普段被ってるベレー帽的なものか他のものを被っている状態でお願いします\nまたコートの前部分のデザイン（蝶野さんのガウンモチーフなので）が見え、かつ前開きでお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@8tchou_woman/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d74afb28/uploads/origins/4f2106c0-64f3-472a-bd50-d1c148772d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd19e861c14ae5953e316903d2806e1b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d74afb28/uploads/origins/4f2106c0-64f3-472a-bd50-d1c148772d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cd19e861c14ae5953e316903d2806e1b, https://si.imgix.net/d74afb28/uploads/origins/4f2106c0-64f3-472a-bd50-d1c148772d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=176985a85c3ec748e1a860ceb12c2ea7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d74afb28/uploads/origins/4f2106c0-64f3-472a-bd50-d1c148772d96?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=695d70d9cc54c7394330f320bf4b3b7b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Can you draw my vtuber in her summer outfit? You can pick pose and background, but can you also provide a version with a transparent background? I'd like to use it for streaming and sns\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1gAQ0yVw_k8sLBfB08hmbsUuVUgk6w7oo/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@8tchou_woman/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/87cb5648/uploads/origins/327d9c59-3e68-4036-8883-d6eed7c36f34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cca57083b5f13abc1d615835fdbb311", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/87cb5648/uploads/origins/327d9c59-3e68-4036-8883-d6eed7c36f34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2cca57083b5f13abc1d615835fdbb311, https://si.imgix.net/87cb5648/uploads/origins/327d9c59-3e68-4036-8883-d6eed7c36f34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=t